<section class="article-copy-block margin-bottom--25-25-25">










































    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">Note that once you set the time zone and currency for your account, you cannot change them. Billing will be based on UTC, rather than the time zone you select.
<br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" /><br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" />
If you begin creating an Apple Ads Advanced account and try to switch to Basic before you’re done, you’ll encounter an error. You’ll need to finish creating your Advanced account — and link it to your App Store Connect account — before you can switch to Apple Ads Basic.</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































</section>
<section class="article-copy-block margin-bottom--25-25-25">










































    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					<h2 class="article-copy-block--heading ">If you’re an agency</h2>
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">If you plan to promote third-party apps, your agency’s Apple Ads campaign group must be linked to your clients’ App Store Connect account. To simplify management and restrict client access to a subset of your campaigns, you can create client-specific campaign groups and manage each client&#39;s campaigns in a different campaign group.
<br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" /><br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" /></p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        








 	
    

	


	


        

         

        



		

        

        

     
     

    

    

    







   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
        <a href="/app-store/help/get-started/0012-link-app-store-connect-accounts" class="more ">Learn how to link a client’s App Store Connect account to an agency account</a>
    
      
    






   

    

































</section>
<section class="article-copy-block margin-bottom--25-25-25">










































    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">Note that your account should be set up by the legal entity that’s invoiced by Apple for all Apple Ads Advanced campaigns (and campaign groups) in the account. Don’t create a campaign group if you’re an agency whose client wants to own their account or be billed directly. If your client would like to be invoiced directly, they should create their own Apple Ads account and invite you as a user.<br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" /><br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" />
</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        








 	
    

	


	


        

         

        



		

        

        

     
     

    

    

    







   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































</section>
<section class="article-copy-block margin-bottom--25-25-25">










































    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					<h2 class="article-copy-block--heading ">Understand the Business<br class="no-br-l br-m no-br-s no-space" /> Details page</h2>
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">The Business Details page in your account contains key information about your company and is used to determine your tax status. After completing the Business Details page during account setup, you can access and make changes to it in your Account Settings any time.
<br class="br-l br-m br-s no-sapce" /><br class="br-l br-m br-s no-sapce" />
The Business Details page includes:</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        








 	
    

	


	


        

         

        



		

        

        

     
     

    

    

    







   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































