					<h2 class="article-copy-block--heading ">Access the Documents page</h2>
                    
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        







    
        

        

 		
		
		


        


		


		

		


        

        

        
		
					
                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">If you run app promotions or campaigns on the App Store in mainland China, you’ll use the Documents page to submit your app and business for approval and check the status of your request. As part of your submission, you may need to upload business licenses and other relevant documents. Like the Business Details page, you can access the Documents page within your Account Settings. Note that the Documents page will only appear in your Account Settings after you’ve added mainland China to an app promotion or campaign.
<br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" /><br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" /></p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        








 	
    

	


	


        

         

        



		

        

        

     
     

    

    

    







   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
